 "text": "Hello there! How's everything going? Sandwiches, wraps, and packed salads are great. Roughly wrapped or inside wrap, yes. A cool box without ice is doable for a sandwich or wrap. Packed salad needs to be in cool box with ice. Tough when you' looking at a full fridge. Definitely bring it in, just fill it up with lots of cold foods and ice before everyone arrives. Pop a bag of sweets in the cooler. Sugar drops fast in the heat, so keep it in the ice.",
